  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div><table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">屬性值</strong></span></p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">體型</strong></span></p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">速度</strong></span></p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">體質</span> +2; <span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">任選一項其他屬性</span> +1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">中型體型</span></p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">30尺</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Age\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">年齡Age。</strong>混生體獲得生命時已經是成年人類、精靈或者維多肯了。它們顯示出輕微加速老化的跡象，因此它們的最大壽命可能會有所減少，但守護者計劃還沒有運行足夠長的時間來觀察這種現象所反映的全部影響。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">陣營Alignment。</strong>總體上大多數混生體都具有析米克聯合的中立特性。他們更感興趣的是科學研究和協會的地位，而不是道德或倫理問題。然而，那些離開聯合的人經常討論道德或倫理問題，因爲他們的哲學觀點和陣營更符合一個不同的公會。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">體型Size。</strong>你屬於中型體型，在你的基礎類人種族範圍內。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">速度Speed。</strong>你的基礎步行速度爲30尺。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">黑暗視覺Darkvision。</strong>在微光光照下，你身邊60尺內可以視爲等同於明亮光照。而在黑暗中，該範圍內可視爲等同於微光光照。你無法在黑暗中分辨顏色，只能看到有灰度的黑白畫面。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">語言 Language。：</strong>你可以說、讀與寫通用語，另外你在維多肯語（需要手動添加）和精靈語中選擇一個獲得說、讀與寫能力<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">動物強化。</strong>你的身體已經被改變以融入某些動物特徵。你現在選擇一個動物強化，然後在第5級選擇第二個強化。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" />在第一級，選擇以下選項之一:</span></p><ul class=\"rd__list rd__list-hang-notitle\"><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Manta Glide\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">蝠鱝滑翔 </strong></span><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Manta Glide.</span> <span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">你的蝠翼可以減緩你的下降，讓你滑翔。當你墜落而沒有失能，在計算墜落傷害時，你可以從墜落高度中減去100英尺，每下降1英尺，你可以水平移動2英尺。</span></p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Nimble Climber\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">靈活攀登 </strong></span><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Nimble Climber.</span><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">你獲得等於你步行速度的攀爬速度。</span></p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Underwater Adaptation\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">水下適應 </strong></span><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Underwater Adaptation.</span> <span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">你可以在水中呼吸空氣，你獲得等於你步行速度的游泳速度。</span></p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">在第5級時，選擇以下選項之一，或者選擇你在第1級時沒有選擇的選項之一:</span></p><ul class=\"rd__list rd__list-hang-notitle\"><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Grappling Appendage\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">鬥毆附件 </strong></span><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Grappling Appendage.</span> <span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">你的手臂旁邊長着兩個特殊的附肢。你可以選擇它們是爪子還是觸手。使用一個動作，你可以使用他們來嘗試擒抱一個生物。這些附肢都是天生武器，你可以用它們進行徒手攻擊。如果你用它攻擊，目標會受到1d6 +你的力量調整值的鈍擊傷害，而非普通徒手攻擊的鈍擊傷害。在擊中目標後，你可以嘗試用附贈動作擒拿抱目標。這些附肢不能精確操控任何東西，也不能使用武器、魔法物品或其他特殊裝備。</span></p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Carapace\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">甲殼 </strong></span><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Carapace.</span> <span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">你皮膚的一些地方被厚厚的外殼 覆蓋着。當你不穿重甲時，你將獲得AC +1加值。</span></p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Acid Spit\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">酸液噴吐 </strong></span><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Acid Spit.</span> <span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">使用動作你可以從口腔的腺體中噴射出一股酸性物質，選擇30英尺內你能看到的一個生物或物體作爲目標。除非其成功通過DC等於8 +你的體質調整值+你的熟練加值的敏捷豁免檢定，否則目標受到2d10強酸傷害。當你達到第11級(3d10)和第17級(4d10)時，傷害增加1d10。該特性的可用次數等於你的體質調整值（至少一次）。通過完成一次長休你可以恢復全部已消耗次數。</span></p></li></ul></div></div><hr class=\"hr-1\" /><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">析米克聯合使用魔法將不同的生命形式融合在一起。近年來，他們將這項研究擴展到類人生物上，用魔法將各種動物的特質轉化至人類、精靈和維多肯身上。他們將此行爲稱之爲守護者計劃。其目標是建立由超能士兵組成的析米克軍隊，以求完美地適應各種戰鬥情況。這些超進化的試驗品被稱爲析米克混生體，然而有時他們也自稱守護者。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">廣泛的適應<br /></strong>儘管大多數混生體保持其基本的身體形態，但混生體的生物性增強可以顯着地改變其外觀。所有的雜拼獸都擁一些動物的物理特性，這些動物主要是水生和爬行或兩棲動物的生物。包括蟹爪，魷魚觸角，蝠鱝的翅膀或鰭，半透明或僞裝的皮膚，或者充滿尖銳牙齒的似鯊魚狀顎。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" />混生體是析米克魔法的產物。對於混生體來說，離開析米克聯合並加入另一個公會並非不可能，但析米克會認爲這個混生體是逃兵，而且新公會可能永遠不會完全歡迎一個能輕易成爲析米克間諜的混生體。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">混生體姓名</strong><br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" />混生體通常帶有人類、精靈或 維多肯父母給出的名字。但是有些混生體在他們的改造之後, 由他們自己或者其轉化者選擇一個新的名字。</span></p></div></div></div><div><table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Ability Scores</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Size</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Speed</p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Constitution +2; Choose any other +1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Medium</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>30 ft.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Age\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Age.</span> Hybrids begin their lives as adult humans, elves, or vedalken. They age at a slightly accelerated rate, so their maximum life spans are probably reduced somewhat. The Guardian Project has not been operating long enough to observe the full effect of this phenomenon.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Alignment\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Alignment.</span> Most hybrids share the generally neutral outlook of the Simic Combine. They are more interested in scientific research and the standing of their guild than in moral or ethical questions. Those who leave the Combine, however, often do so because their philosophical outlook and alignment are more in line with a different guild's.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Size\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Size.</span> Your size is Medium, within the normal range of your humanoid base race.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Darkvision\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Darkvision.</span> You can see in dim light within 60 feet of you as if it were bright light, and in darkness as if it were dim light. You can't discern color in darkness, only shades of gray.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Languages\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Languages.</span> You can speak, read, and write Common and your choice of Elvish or Vedalken.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Animal Enhancement\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Animal Enhancement.</span> Your body has been altered to incorporate certain animal characteristics. You choose one animal enhancement now and a second enhancement at 5th level.</p><p>At 1st level, choose one of the following options:</p><ul class=\"rd__list rd__list-hang-notitle\"><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Manta Glide\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Manta Glide.</span> You have ray-like fins that you can use as wings to slow your fall or allow you to glide. When you fall and aren't &amp;Reference[condition=incapacitated], you can subtract up to 100 feet from the fall when calculating falling damage, and you can move up to 2 feet horizontally for every 1 foot you descend.</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Nimble Climber\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Nimble Climber.</span> You have a climbing speed equal to your walking speed.</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Underwater Adaptation\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Underwater Adaptation.</span> You can breathe air and water, and you have a swimming speed equal to your walking speed.</p></li></ul><p>At 5th level, your body evolves further, developing new characteristics. Choose one of the options you didn't take at 1st level, or one of the following options:</p><ul class=\"rd__list rd__list-hang-notitle\"><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Grappling Appendage\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Grappling Appendage.</span> You have two special appendages growing alongside your arms. Choose whether they're both claws or tentacles. As an action, you can use one of them to try to grapple a creature. Each one is also a natural weapon, which you can use to make an unarmed strike. If you hit with it, the target takes bludgeoning damage equal to [[/damage 1d6]] + your Strength modifier, instead of the bludgeoning damage normal for an unarmed strike. Immediately after hitting, you can try to grapple the target as a bonus action. These appendages can't precisely manipulate anything and can't wield weapons, magic items, or other specialized equipment.</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Carapace\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Carapace.</span> Your skin in places is covered by a thick shell. You gain a +1 bonus to AC when you're not wearing heavy armor.</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Acid Spit\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Acid Spit.</span> As an action, you can spray acid from glands in your mouth, targeting one creature or object you can see within 30 feet of you. The target takes [[/damage 2d10 type=acid]] damage unless it succeeds on a Dexterity saving throw against a DC equal to 8 + your Constitution modifier + your proficiency bonus. This damage increases by [[/damage 1d10]] when you reach 11th level ([[/damage 3d10]]) and 17th level ([[/damage 4d10]]). You can use this trait a number of times equal to your Constitution modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses of it when you finish a long rest.</p></li></ul></div></div><hr class=\"hr-1\" /><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p>The Simic Combine uses magic to fuse different life forms together. In recent years, the Simic Combine has extended this research to humanoid subjects, magically transferring the traits of various animals into humans, elves, and vedalken. The goal of the Guardian Project is to build a Simic army of soldiers perfectly adapted to a variety of combat situations. These hyper-evolved specimens are called Simic hybrids, though they sometimes refer to themselves as guardians.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Extensive Adaptation\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Extensive Adaptation.</span> A hybrid's biological enhancements can change its appearance drastically, though most hybrids retain their basic physical form. All are augmented with characteristics of animals, mostly aquatic, reptilian, or amphibian creatures. These include crab claws, squid tentacles, wings or fins like those of manta rays, translucent or camouflaged skin, or shark-like maws filled with sharp teeth.</p><p>Hybrids are the product of Simic magic. It's not impossible for a hybrid to leave the Simic Combine and join another guild, but the Simic would consider the individual a deserter. And the new guild might never fully welcome a hybrid who could easily be a Simic spy.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Simic Hybrid Names\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Simic Hybrid Names.</span> A hybrid usually bears the name given by their human, elf, or vedalken parents. Some hybrids assume a new name after their transformation—a name chosen personally or by those who transformed them.</p></div></div></div></div>",
